<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5931"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Brazilian<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Brazilian<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 11:14 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I dont have a BTK´s profile of my own, but I strongly believe in these things: <BR> <BR>- He´s not 60 yet.   <BR>- He loves, and probably worked with, phography and drawings. <BR>- He has NOT military experience. Maybe he even served but was dismissed. <BR>- He has NOT radio operation experience. Maybe he´s just a little curious about it. <BR>- I think he never got married. <BR>- He seems to be that kinda person who speaks in a very formal way. Kinda geek. <BR>- He did some time in jail after he commited his crimes, but was not linked to them.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
