EVER WOULD MOVE FAR FROM WICHITA it means to much to him. <BR>Currently facing life threatening illness possibley prostate cancer. <BR>Shirley Vian murder last minute substition for another planned victim. <BR>Nancy Fox was well planned and BTK knew her. Because of this he was questioned by police after her murder. <BR>He tried to mislead police by claiming both Vian and Fox where not pre-planned. Only Vian was not pre-planned.  <BR> <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
