cause of what they represented. FAMILY, I think he taught Judo, that is why he knows the children. The Big letter T means a alot to him, it&#39;s a Self Idea in Psychology concerning aggressive behavior, I can elaborate if you want me to. I believe he quit college in his 3rd year he would have been 20. Got married, beat his wife and she left. That&#39;s what set him off.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
