</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lilymarie<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 19, 2005 - 4:02 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->•Latino – or Latino/Caucasian. Possibly Puerto Rican or Cuban. <BR> <BR>•Reared in a Catholic household, in Wichita. Home was a place where he was allowed no opinion, and was discounted. At least one parent &#40;probably mother or stepmother&#41; used sarcasm and humiliation as punishment for not doing chores, making poor grades or failing in sports.  <BR> <BR>•Collected crime comics as a pre-teen/teen. Particularly interested in women being tied up and beaten and the suggestion of sexual assault. <BR> <BR>•Obsessed with thoughts of forced sex and masturbation as a teen &#40;far in excess of a normal teenage boy&#41;. <BR> <BR>•Non-consensual incestuous relationship with a cousin or younger sister &#40;imo – Latina&#41;. Or, possibly a young neighbor girl. Family found out and he was forced to join the services. <BR> <BR>•Had early success in the military – which perpetuated a developing narcissistic personality. <BR> <BR>•Served in the military, combat/ground assault training, possibly in the Panama Canal Zone. Was deeply affected by being singled out by one or more superiors for discipline. Did not feel respect for his superiors for many reasons – but mostly because he felt they were inferior in intellect. One or more of his superiors were younger than him and humiliated him on more than one occasion. He was forced to keep his anger in check. IMO – this is his somehow a connection to Joseph Otero. <BR> <BR>•Moved back to Wichita after completing service. Lived at home only long enough to get his own place – he soon felt disgust and disdain for his family. In his mind, they were beneath his status and intelligence. <BR> <BR>•During the 1970’s and 1980’s his job involved a lot of driving around Wichita and possibly the Kansas Missouri area. &#40;union: telephone tech/lineman, aircraft service/install?&#41;  <BR> <BR>•He took night and weekend courses at WSU – mostly because it made him feel superior to his mostly blue-collar co-workers and line management. It was also used as a method to help him feel superior to his father who was very uneducated. He took a poetry class – and used this as a “mental edge” by which to fuel his sense of being on a higher level than others around him. He received some sort of encouragement in this area by PJ Wyatt. He hung out at local WSU taverns and dives because he thought that’s what one would do if one were an “intellectual”. He met at least one victim this way. <BR> <BR>•He worked with people, and was a smooth talker. Yet co-workers and some customers sensed over time that he felt superior and was putting on a front. The more intuitive of these people were uncomfortable to the point of being frightened. <BR> <BR>•His relationships were with women that were shy, insecure, and naive. He groomed them over time to engage in increasingly kinky sexual behaviors. He was, however, very rarely interested in physical sex. He preferred masturbation while acting out a very specific fantasy. These fantasies required women to perform degrading and painful acts upon themselves. <BR> <BR>•Once women were either emotionally or financially indebted to him – he began to escalate abusive behavior of all kinds. He was possibly married to one or more of these women. He was able to smooth-talk neighbors, and kept his home and yard up enough to seem normal. His wife/wives rarely left the house. <BR> <BR>•He has/had an extensive collection of bondage devices. He also has/had a collection of bondage related pornography. He has pictures and other media of his former and/or current girlfriends/ wives. He also has all kinds of media – whatever technology allowed at the time – of his BTK victims. <BR> <BR>•After the last murder – there was one or more sort of “close call” – as far as being discovered. I believe he was in the early process of committing his 9th murder when something went horribly wrong. It was never attributed to him or the potential victim never knew- but it was a strong shock. I also believe that his wife may have discovered who he was and came very close to being able to turn him in. She was probably murdered shortly after that – but it appeared to be an accident or a natural death. <BR> <BR>•For many years he has been too afraid of being caught to physically commit the kinds of sadistic killings that he enjoyed so much.Since it is a sense of power he seeks – his second choice of relieving himself of what he calls the “monster” is to exert his power over the community of Wichita. It’s working…  <BR> <BR>•He’s the guy next door. Possibly recently retired. Drives a small truck &#40;white&#41; with lightly tinted windows. No pets. No family visitors. Sticks to a very rigid routine. Says “Hi” but doesn’t look you in the eye. <BR> <BR>Lily <BR> <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
