<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8199"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Johno<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Johno<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 21, 2005 - 12:54 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->- White male born between 1947 and 1952. <BR>- Absense of father growing up. <BR>- Early years in a rainy climate. Most likely <BR>  Wichita. <BR>- Some juvinile delinqincy problems. <BR>- Has a traffic record which may include drunken, <BR>  reckless, or careless driving but not  <BR>  necessarily a conviction. Has recieved moving <BR>  violations. <BR>- Served in the Navy and had an early discharge. <BR>- May have been acussed of attempted rape or <BR>  being a peeping Tom while in the service.  <BR>  May have gotten away with a murder while in <BR>  the service. <BR>- Has an interest in comic books, science fiction, <BR>  English literature, renaisance fairs, poetry, <BR>  crime novels, true crime stories, detective <BR>  magazines, violent pornography. <BR>- Above average intellegence but has never lived <BR>  up to his potential in jobs he has held. <BR>- Had been involved in burglary, breaking and <BR>  entering and window peeping prior to becoming <BR>  a killer. <BR>- Once drove an Chevy El Camino, Ford Ranchero <BR>  or a Ford Torino. <BR>- If his name was Thomas or Robert or Joseph <BR>  for example, he would not have been called <BR>  Tom or Bob or Joe but rather Tommy, Bobby <BR>  or Joey by his family and everyone who knew <BR>  him. <BR>- Changed his hair with the times. Wore long <BR>  sideburns in the late 60&#39;s and had his hair  <BR>  permed in the late 70&#39;s. Wore a mustache. <BR>  Today may have a shaved head or closely <BR>  cropped hair and has a mustache and a goatee. <BR>- Enjoyed stalking victims he did not know <BR>  but that didn&#39;t preclude him from stalking <BR>  victims he did know or who had met. <BR>- Has lived in the Wichita area for most of <BR>  his life. Has relatives today in Wichita. <BR>- Not married. If ever married was not for long. <BR>- Has today at least two vehicles. A GMC truck <BR>  and a small American made two door sedan. <BR>- As police study him, he studies them. <BR> <!--/Text--></td></tr>
